---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout pageTitle="About Diego Martin | Lead Software Engineer" description="More about Diego Martin, a software engineer and technical leader based in Malaga, Spain.">
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-[#0b1110] px-6 py-24 text-white sm:px-10 lg:px-12">
    <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.22em] text-emerald-400">About</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Diego Martin</h1>
      <p class="mt-8 text-xl leading-9 text-zinc-300">I’m a Lead Software Engineer based in Malaga, Spain, with 20 years of experience building software and helping teams solve complex problems.</p>
      <p class="mt-6 leading-8 text-zinc-400">My work spans software architecture, event sourcing, CQRS, event-driven systems, domain-driven design, cloud infrastructure, and engineering leadership. I enjoy creating a clear technical direction and working alongside teams to deliver reliable products.</p>
      <p class="mt-6 leading-8 text-zinc-400">I currently lead engineering work at Vitesse, building payment solutions. Before that, I led product and architecture work across SaaS, travel, and other domains.</p>
      <a href="/#contact" class="mt-10 inline-flex rounded-full bg-emerald-400 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-zinc-950 transition hover:bg-emerald-300">Get in touch</a>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
